  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Time Release Studies on Measuring and Benchmarking Customs and Border Management Performance in COMESA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to help COMESA Secretariat and Member States build the capacity to conduct TRS for pursuing trade facilitation in a standardized manner. For this, the specific objectives of the project are: to develop a TRS model which is based upon the WCO TRS model with the required modifications to meet  the COMESA Members&apos; needs and requirements; to build capacity in designing and implementing the national TRS process and analyzing the TRS results.</narrative>
  </description>
